OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade: Judge urges
OL,4,Aparties to reach agreement and 'step
OL,5,Aback from the abyss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge hearing the legal challenge to
OL,8,Fthe Parades Commission's decision to
OL,9,Fallow the Orange Order to march along
OL,10,Fthe Garvaghy Road in Portadown has
OL,11,Fgiven the parties involved a final
OL,12,Fopportunity to "reach an agreement" and
OL,13,F"step back from the abyss".
OL,15,FJudge Patricia Smyth said the issue the
OL,16,Fcourt is dealing with is of
OL,17,F"fundamental importance" to the entire
OL,18,Fsociety in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
